I will encourage you for next time to provide some sample data. Until next time, here's a piece of code that works for me. Is this what you're after?

mydf <- data.frame(
        provider = rep(letters[1:4], 20),
        quart = seq(from = as.Date("2011-09-01"), to = as.Date("2011-09-30"), length.out = 20),
        customers = runif(20) * 200)
head(mydf)

library(ggplot2)
ggplot(mydf, aes(x = quart, y = customers)) + geom_line() + facet_wrap(~ provider)

Cheers,
Roman

