Simplifying for the moment, this:

pbaseline+geom_smooth(method = "lm", se = FALSE, size =
1.2)+scale_color_manual(values = c("#000000", "#666666", "#CCCCCC"))

produces a plot with the geom_smooth lines black, grey, etc., colored
by 'char'. Is this what you want?

Ben

