Gavin,

Your example produces a nice plot, but there's no 'outcome' or 'covar'
variables (which you reference in your question). Can you provide a
more complete data set? I'm not clear, since you already have a
working plot for a single case, why you couldn't simply add
'+facet_grid(outcome~covar)' using a larger data set.

Regards,
Ben

